  "final_message": "Implemented the full app.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`)\n- SQLite (`./data/notes.db`) with users, bearer-token sessions, and notes\n- Register (201), login (`{\"token\"}`), plus `/api/auth/me` and logout\n- Notes CRUD scoped to the owner (others get 404), summaries omit bodies, sorted by `updated_at` desc\n- Markdown rendering via `markdown` + `bleach` sanitizing; `/api/notes/{id}/html` (auth) and `/api/public/notes/{id}/html` (published only)\n- `POST /api/render` for the live preview, public metadata endpoint, `/api/health`, and SPA fallback hosting of `frontend/dist`\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src`, React + TS + Tailwind v4)\n- Register/sign-in forms, signed-in username and sign-out\n- Notes list with published badges, newest first\n- Editor with Markdown textarea, debounced API-rendered preview, autosave, published switch, copyable public link, delete\n- Public page at `/p/{id}` showing title, author, and sanitized rendered HTML\n\nVerified with API flow tests, restart persistence, `tsc --noEmit`, and Vite production builds. `requirements.lock` and `package-lock.json` are updated.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
